  "name": "Erg Session — Four Rowers, Two Ergs",
  "description": "Two ergs in the bay used by pairs. A/B warm up first, C/D come in on the next hand-off. Three 4-minute pieces alternate through the machine hand-offs; then one rower at a time does a coached technique drill. Cooldown on the floor and coach debrief.",
